WEBVTT

00:02:28.936 --> 00:02:31.522
the demand for goats goes up,

00:02:31.522 --> 00:02:33.983
and the price skyrockets.

00:02:34.859 --> 00:02:37.612
I remembered my goats

00:02:37.612 --> 00:02:42.241
and decided to put up a post on Facebook

00:02:42.241 --> 00:02:47.997
asking my friends and family
to buy their Eid goat from me that year.

00:02:48.748 --> 00:02:52.084
Within a week I sold all my goats.

00:02:52.084 --> 00:02:57.965
And even after paying for a team
to do transport and manage them,

00:02:57.965 --> 00:03:01.344
I more than recovered
the cost of the pump.